"promotionalText" = "The perfect pet-raising game for couples and friends! Check out our major store redesign and start decorating your shared room today.";
"description" = "PetTomo is the shared pet game where your photos become your pet's favorite food.\n\nDesigned for couples, best friends, and family, PetTomo brings you closer through the simple act of sharing daily moments. No matter the distance, you can co-raise a unique virtual pet together.\n\nCO-RAISE WITH LOVE\nInvite your partner or best friend to join your shared room. Together, you’ll care for a pet that grows based on your interactions.\n\nPHOTO FEEDING SYSTEM\nYour daily photos are the fuel! Take pictures of your lunch, your commute, or a sunset, and send them to your pet. Watch as your pet eats up your memories and grows happier with every share.\n\nDECORATE YOUR SHARED HOME\nEarn rewards to buy furniture and backgrounds. Style your room to reflect your shared taste and create a cozy space for your pet.\n\nSTAY CONNECTED THROUGH CHAT\nBuilt-in room chat lets you react to each other’s photos and stay in touch while looking after your pet. Every notification is a reminder that someone is thinking of you.\n\nCOLLECT MEMORIES\nLook back through your pet’s photo diary to relive all the small moments that make your bond special.\n\nWhether you’re in a long-distance relationship or just want a new way to stay connected, PetTomo turns everyday sharing into a rewarding and meaningful journey.\n\nDownload PetTomo today and start growing your shared bond!";
